#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Cancel extracurricular participant\n"
"Database ID: %(id)s\n"
"Problem: An addendum fee line on the payment term is already locked\n"
"Solution: The enrollment has already been opened around this fee;\n"
"it can no longer be cancelled through this document\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Batalkan peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %(id)s\n"
"Masalah: Baris biaya adendum pada termin pembayaran sudah terkunci\n"
"Solusi: Pendaftaran sudah dibuka terkait biaya ini; peserta tidak\n"
"lagi dapat dibatalkan melalui dokumen ini\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/wizards/school_extracurricular_create_due_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Create due invoice for extracurricular payment terms\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: No uninvoiced payment term of Student '%s' is due on or\n"
"before %s\n"
"Solution: Choose a Student with due payment terms, or extend Due Date\n"
"Until\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Buat faktur jatuh tempo untuk termin pembayaran ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Tidak ada termin pembayaran Siswa '%s' yang belum ditagih\n"
"dan jatuh tempo pada atau sebelum %s\n"
"Solusi: Pilih Siswa yang memiliki termin pembayaran jatuh tempo, atau\n"
"perpanjang Jatuh Tempo Hingga\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/wizards/school_extracurricular_create_due_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Create due invoice for extracurricular payment terms\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: The due payment terms' offerings do not share the same\n"
"Receivable Journal, Receivable Account, and Customer Invoice Type\n"
"Solution: Invoice the disagreeing offerings' payment terms separately,\n"
"or align their accounting configuration first\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Buat faktur jatuh tempo untuk termin pembayaran ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Penyelenggaraan pada termin pembayaran jatuh tempo tidak\n"
"memiliki Jurnal Piutang, Akun Piutang, dan Jenis Faktur Pelanggan yang\n"
"sama\n"
"Solusi: Fakturkan termin pembayaran penyelenggaraan yang tidak sesuai\n"
"secara terpisah, atau samakan konfigurasi akuntansinya terlebih dahulu\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_enrollment.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Finish enrollment\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Extracurricular payment term '%s' has a customer invoice\n"
"that is not yet Unpaid/Paid\n"
"Solution: Confirm and open the standalone invoice before finishing\n"
"this enrollment\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Selesaikan pendaftaran\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Termin pembayaran ekstrakurikuler '%s' memiliki faktur\n"
"pelanggan yang belum berstatus Belum Dibayar/Dibayar\n"
"Solusi: Konfirmasi dan buka faktur mandiri sebelum menyelesaikan\n"
"pendaftaran ini\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Open extracurricular participant\n"
"Database ID: %(id)s\n"
"Problem: Allocated Payment Term '%(term)s' is already %(state)s\n"
"Solution: Remove or replace the Allocation line pointing to that\n"
"Payment Term before opening\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Buka peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %(id)s\n"
"Masalah: Termin Pembayaran yang dialokasikan '%(term)s' sudah %(state)s\n"
"Solusi: Hapus atau ganti baris Alokasi yang menunjuk ke Termin\n"
"Pembayaran tersebut sebelum membuka\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Open extracurricular participant\n"
"Database ID: %(id)s\n"
"Problem: Billing Mode is 'Charged to Enrollment' but no Allocation\n"
"line is set\n"
"Solution: Add at least one Allocation line pointing to an enrollment\n"
"payment term before opening\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Buka peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %(id)s\n"
"Masalah: Mode Penagihan adalah 'Dibebankan ke Pendaftaran' tetapi tidak\n"
"ada baris Alokasi\n"
"Solusi: Tambahkan setidaknya satu baris Alokasi yang menunjuk ke termin\n"
"pembayaran pendaftaran sebelum membuka\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Open extracurricular participant\n"
"Database ID: %(id)s\n"
"Problem: Group '%(group)s' has reached its maximum quota of\n"
"%(quota)s\n"
"Solution: Increase the Group's Maximum Quota, place this participant\n"
"in a different Group, or cancel an existing participant in the Group\n"
"before opening a new one\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Buka peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %(id)s\n"
"Masalah: Kelompok '%(group)s' telah mencapai kuota maksimum sebesar\n"
"%(quota)s\n"
"Solusi: Tambah Kuota Maksimum Kelompok, tempatkan peserta ini pada\n"
"Kelompok lain, atau batalkan peserta yang ada di Kelompok sebelum\n"
"membuka peserta baru\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Open extracurricular participant\n"
"Database ID: %(id)s\n"
"Problem: Offering '%(offering)s' has reached its maximum quota of\n"
"%(quota)s\n"
"Solution: Increase the Offering's Maximum Quota, or cancel an\n"
"existing participant before opening a new one\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Buka peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %(id)s\n"
"Masalah: Penyelenggaraan '%(offering)s' telah mencapai kuota maksimum\n"
"sebesar %(quota)s\n"
"Solusi: Tambah Kuota Maksimum Penyelenggaraan, atau batalkan peserta\n"
"yang ada sebelum membuka peserta baru\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Open extracurricular participant\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Student '%s' already has an active participation on\n"
"Offering '%s'\n"
"Solution: Cancel or finish the existing participation before\n"
"opening a new one\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Buka peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Siswa '%s' sudah memiliki keikutsertaan aktif pada\n"
"Penyelenggaraan '%s'\n"
"Solusi: Batalkan atau selesaikan keikutsertaan yang ada sebelum\n"
"membuka yang baru\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_offering.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular offering academic term\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Academic Term '%s' does not belong to Academic Year '%s'\n"
"Solution: Select an Academic Term that belongs to the selected Academic\n"
"Year\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur periode akademik penyelenggaraan ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Periode Akademik '%s' bukan bagian dari Tahun Ajaran '%s'\n"
"Solusi: Pilih Periode Akademik yang termasuk dalam Tahun Ajaran yang\n"
"dipilih\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_offering.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular offering coach\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Both Teacher and External Coach are filled\n"
"Solution: Select only one of Teacher or External Coach\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur pelatih penyelenggaraan ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Guru dan Pelatih Eksternal sama-sama terisi\n"
"Solusi: Pilih hanya salah satu dari Guru atau Pelatih Eksternal\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_offering.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular offering coach\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Neither Teacher nor External Coach is filled\n"
"Solution: Select either a Teacher or an External Coach\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur pelatih penyelenggaraan ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Guru dan Pelatih Eksternal sama-sama kosong\n"
"Solusi: Pilih salah satu dari Guru atau Pelatih Eksternal\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_offering_group.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular offering group\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Code '%s' is already used by another group on the same\n"
"Offering\n"
"Solution: Use a different Code, or leave it empty\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur kelompok penyelenggaraan ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Kode '%s' sudah dipakai oleh kelompok lain pada\n"
"Penyelenggaraan yang sama\n"
"Solusi: Gunakan Kode yang berbeda, atau biarkan kosong\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_offering.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular offering period\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: End Date '%s' is earlier than Start Date '%s'\n"
"Solution: Select an End Date that is not earlier than the Start Date\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur periode penyelenggaraan ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Tanggal Selesai '%s' lebih awal dari Tanggal Mulai '%s'\n"
"Solusi: Pilih Tanggal Selesai yang tidak lebih awal dari Tanggal Mulai\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_offering.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular offering quota\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Maximum Quota '%s' is lower than Minimum Quota '%s'\n"
"Solution: Set a Maximum Quota that is not lower than the Minimum Quota,\n"
"or leave it at 0 for no upper limit\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur kuota penyelenggaraan ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Kuota Maksimum '%s' lebih rendah dari Kuota Minimum '%s'\n"
"Solusi: Atur Kuota Maksimum yang tidak lebih rendah dari Kuota Minimum,\n"
"atau biarkan 0 bila tanpa batas atas\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant_allocation.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular participant allocation\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Payment term '%s' does not belong to the same enrollment as\n"
"Participant '%s'\n"
"Solution: Select a Payment Term that belongs to the Participant's\n"
"Enrollment\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur alokasi peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Termin pembayaran '%s' bukan bagian dari pendaftaran yang sama\n"
"dengan Peserta '%s'\n"
"Solusi: Pilih Termin Pembayaran yang termasuk dalam Pendaftaran Peserta\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant_allocation.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular participant allocation\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Payment term '%s' is already %s\n"
"Solution: Select a Payment Term that has not been invoiced or paid yet\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur alokasi peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Termin pembayaran '%s' sudah %s\n"
"Solusi: Pilih Termin Pembayaran yang belum difaktur atau dibayar\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant_allocation.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular participant allocation\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Total allocation %s does not match Participant fee %s\n"
"Solution: Adjust the allocation lines so their total matches the\n"
"Participant's Untaxed Amount\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur alokasi peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Total alokasi %s tidak sama dengan biaya Peserta %s\n"
"Solusi: Sesuaikan baris alokasi sehingga totalnya sama dengan Jumlah\n"
"Sebelum Pajak Peserta\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular participant enrollment\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Enrollment '%s' does not belong to Student '%s'\n"
"Solution: Select an Enrollment that belongs to the selected Student\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur pendaftaran peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Pendaftaran '%s' bukan milik Siswa '%s'\n"
"Solusi: Pilih Pendaftaran yang dimiliki oleh Siswa yang dipilih\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular participant enrollment\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Enrollment academic term '%s' does not match Offering\n"
"academic term '%s'\n"
"Solution: Select an Enrollment for the same academic term as the\n"
"Offering\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur pendaftaran peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Periode akademik pendaftaran '%s' tidak sama dengan periode\n"
"akademik Penyelenggaraan '%s'\n"
"Solusi: Pilih Pendaftaran untuk periode akademik yang sama dengan\n"
"Penyelenggaraan\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_extracurricular_participant.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set extracurricular participant group\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Group '%s' does not belong to Offering '%s'\n"
"Solution: Select a Group that belongs to the selected Offering\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Atur kelompok peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Kelompok '%s' bukan bagian dari Penyelenggaraan '%s'\n"
"Solusi: Pilih Kelompok yang termasuk dalam Penyelenggaraan yang dipilih\n"

#. module: ssi_school_extracurricular
#: code:addons/ssi_school_extracurricular/models/school_enrollment_payment_term_extra_detail.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Update payment term extra detail\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Payment term extra detail '%s' is already invoiced and its\n"
"account classification cannot be changed\n"
"Solution: The invoiced amount is already booked on the current\n"
"account; book a correction through the extracurricular participant\n"
"instead\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Perbarui detail tambahan termin pembayaran\n"
"ID Basis Data: %s\n"
"Masalah: Detail tambahan termin pembayaran '%s' sudah difaktur dan\n"
"klasifikasi akunnya tidak dapat diubah\n"
"Solusi: Jumlah yang difaktur sudah dibukukan pada akun saat ini;\n"
"bukukan koreksi melalui peserta ekstrakurikuler\n"

